{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/chunkyjump1.gif?t=1743522878\" />A new short horror adventure from the world of <i><strong>The Bunny Graveyard</strong></i>, for new and returning players alike!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By day, you run a small gas station in <i>Carrot Town</i>, serving its quirky citizens, stocking supplies, and keeping business afloat. By night, you must outwit and survive a terrifying monster that lurks in the shadows... all while playing a little game called <strong>Chunky JUMP!\u00a0</strong>on your trusty BIRD BOY. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SURVIVE </strong>the night, keep your focus, time your jumps, and don\u2019t let the fear break your concentration. Survive until morning\u2026 if you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PLAY</strong> as Jeff, the gas station worker and talk with the residents of Carrot Town!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>LISTEN</strong> to the mysteries going on in Carrot Town, learn new information and make your own conclusions...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the <strong>STORY MODE</strong> and find out more about Carrot Town's mysteries and citizens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the <strong>ENDLESS MODE</strong> to play multiple new levels and collect skins of familiar faces!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn Bun-Bun coins by completing <strong>ACHIEVEMENTS</strong>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3606780?t=1743522878","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3606780?t=1743522878","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c